   "source": [
    "# BigWorld Engine 14.4.1 完整构建流程\n",
    "\n",
    "本 Notebook 记录了从零开始构建 BigWorld Engine 14.4.1 服务器和客户端的完整流程。\n",
    "\n",
    "## 环境\n",
    "\n",
    "| 项目 | 值 |\n",
    "|------|------|\n",
    "| 宿主系统 | Windows + WSL Debian 12 (bookworm) |\n",
    "| 目标平台 | el7 (CentOS 7 兼容) |\n",
    "| 编译器 | GCC 14.x |\n",
    "| 构建根目录 | `/home/great/bw-build` |\n",
    "\n",
    "## 目录\n",
    "1. [环境准备](#1-环境准备)\n",
    "2. [服务器构建](#2-服务器构建)\n",
    "3. [客户端构建](#3-客户端构建)\n",
    "4. [构建后配置](#4-构建后配置)\n",
    "5. [运行时部署](#5-运行时部署)\n",
    "6. [常见问题排查](#6-常见问题排查)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. 环境准备\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1.1 配置清华镜像源（可选，加速 apt）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%%bash\n",
    "sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list << 'EOF'\n",
    "deb https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/debian/ bookworm main contrib non-free non-free-firmware\n",
    "deb https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/debian/ bookworm-updates main contrib non-free non-free-firmware\n",
    "deb https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/debian/ bookworm-backports main contrib non-free non-free-firmware\n",
    "deb https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/debian-security bookworm-security main contrib non-free non-free-firmware\n",
    "EOF\n",
    "sudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade -y"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 1.2 安装系统构建依赖"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%%bash\n",
    "sudo apt install -y \\\n",
    "    build-essential g++ make scons python3 python3-pip \\\n",
    "    bison flex autoconf automake libtool pkg-config \\\n",
    "    libssl-dev zlib1g-dev libbz2-dev libreadline-dev libsqlite3-dev \\\n",
    "    libffi-dev libncursesw5-dev libgdbm-dev liblzma-dev libexpat1-dev \\\n",
    "    libxml2-dev libxslt1-dev libcurl4-openssl-dev \\\n",
    "    libboost-all-dev libmysqlclient-dev libpq-dev \\\n",
    "    libxml2-utils xsltproc docbook-xsl \\\n",
    "    git subversion wget curl unzip"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 1.3 模拟 CentOS 7 平台\n",
    "\n",
    "BigWorld 构建系统通过 `/etc/redhat-release` 检测目标平台为 el7。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%%bash\n",
    "# 创建 redhat-release\n",
    "echo \"CentOS Linux release 7.9.2009 (Core)\" | sudo tee /etc/redhat-release\n",
    "\n",
    "# 创建 mysql_config 符号链接\n",
    "sudo mkdir -p /usr/lib64/mysql\n",
    "sudo ln -sf /usr/bin/mariadb_config /usr/lib64/mysql/mysql_config"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 1.4 复制源码到 WSL 原生文件系统\n",
    "\n",
    "将源码从 Windows 挂载路径复制到 WSL 原生 ext4 文件系统，大幅提升 I/O 性能。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%%bash\n",
    "cp -r /mnt/j/Work/BigWorld-Engine-14.4.1 /home/great/bw-build"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 1.5 修复 CRLF 行尾\n",
    "\n",
    "Windows 上的文件可能包含 CRLF 行尾，需要转换为 LF。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%%bash\n",
    "cd /home/great/bw-build/programming\n",
    "grep -rIlP '\\r$' ./bigworld 2>/dev/null | xargs -r -d '\\n' sed -i 's/\\r$//'"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 2. 服务器构建\n",
    "\n",
    "### 2.1 一键构建（推荐）\n",
    "\n",
    "使用 `build_bigworld_server.sh` 脚本完成全部构建（依赖安装 → 源码复制 → 第三方库构建 → 补丁应用 → 服务器编译）。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 在 Windows PowerShell 中执行（通过 WSL 调用）\n",
    "wsl -d Debian -- bash /mnt/j/Work/BigWorld-Engine-14.4.1/build_bigworld_server.sh"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "可选参数：\n",
    "- `--skip-deps`：跳过依赖安装\n",
    "- `--skip-copy`：跳过源码复制（仅打补丁和构建）\n",
    "- `--patches-only`：仅应用补丁"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 2.2 手动分步构建 — 第三方库\n",
    "\n",
    "如果需要手动构建，按以下顺序执行。\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 2.2.1 构建 Python 2.7"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%%bash\n",
    "cd /home/great/bw-build/programming/bigworld/third_party/python\n",
    "\n",
    "# 修复 sinpi 符号冲突\n",
    "sed -i 's/sinpi/bw_sinpi/g' Modules/mathmodule.c\n",
    "\n",
    "# 配置并编译\n",
    "./configure --prefix=$PWD/../build --enable-shared\n",
    "make -j$(nproc) && make install"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 2.2.2 构建 OpenSSL"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%%bash\n",
    "cd /home/great/bw-build/programming/bigworld/third_party/openssl\n",
    "./config --prefix=$PWD/../build shared zlib\n",
    "make -j$(nproc) && make install"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 2.2.3 构建 cURL"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%%bash\n",
    "# 先修复 gzguts.h\n",
    "sed -i '/#include <fcntl.h>/a #include <unistd.h>' \\\n",
    "    /home/great/bw-build/programming/bigworld/third_party/zlib/gzguts.h\n",
    "\n",
    "cd /home/great/bw-build/programming/bigworld/third_party/libcurl-el7\n",
    "./buildconf || true\n",
    "CFLAGS=\"-Wno-error=implicit-int -Wno-error=int-conversion \\\n",
    "         -Wno-error=implicit-function-declaration \\\n",
    "         -Wno-error=incompatible-pointer-types \\\n",
    "         -Wno-error=discarded-qualifiers\" \\\n",
    "./configure --prefix=$PWD/../build --with-ssl --disable-shared\n",
    "make -j$(nproc) && make install"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 2.2.4 构建 MongoDB C++ 驱动（最复杂）\n",
    "\n",
    "需要创建 Boost 符号链接、endian.hpp 垫片、修复 GCC 14 兼容性，详见 `build_bigworld_server.sh` 中 `phase3_mongodb()` 函数。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%%bash\n",
    "# 此步骤包含大量补丁，建议直接使用 build_bigworld_server.sh\n",
    "# 以下仅展示最终编译命令\n",
    "MONGO_SRC=/home/great/bw-build/programming/bigworld/third_party/mongodb/mongo_cxx_driver/mongo_cxx_driver\n",
    "cd $MONGO_SRC\n",
    "\n",
    "scons --c++11=C++11 --full --use-system-boost --disable-warnings-as-errors \\\n",
    "    --prefix=$PWD/../build \\\n",
    "    --libpath=\"/home/great/bw-build/programming/bigworld/third_party/mongodb/boost/build/lib\" \\\n",
    "    --cpppath=/usr/include \\\n",
    "    install-mongoclient"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 2.3 手动分步构建 — 源码补丁\n",
    "\n",
    "以下补丁解决 GCC 14 兼容性和链接顺序问题。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%%bash\n",
    "cd /home/great/bw-build/programming/bigworld\n",
    "\n",
    "# 补丁 1: 禁用 -Werror\n",
    "sed -i 's/^\\([^#]*\\)CXXFLAGS[[:space:]]*+= -Werror/#CXXFLAGS\\t+= -Werror/' \\\n",
    "    build/make/platform_group_redhat.mak\n",
    "\n",
    "# 补丁 2: 添加 GCC 14 兼容性 CFLAGS\n",
    "sed -i '/^CXXFLAGS += -Wfloat-equal/a CFLAGS += -Wno-error=implicit-function-declaration -Wno-error=implicit-int -Wno-error=int-conversion -Wno-error=incompatible-pointer-types -Wno-error=discarded-qualifiers\\nCXXFLAGS += -Wno-error=deprecated-declarations -Wno-error=class-memaccess -Wno-error=stringop-truncation' \\\n",
    "    build/make/platform_common.mak\n",
    "\n",
    "# 补丁 3: 修复 bw_map.hpp\n",
    "sed -i 's/BW::StlAllocator< std::pair< Key, T > >/BW::StlAllocator< std::pair< const Key, T > >/g' \\\n",
    "    lib/cstdmf/bw_map.hpp\n",
    "\n",
    "# 补丁 4: SIGUNUSED -> SIGSYS\n",
    "sed -i 's/sigNum <= SIGUNUSED/sigNum <= SIGSYS/' lib/server/signal_processor.cpp\n",
    "\n",
    "# 补丁 5: 无条件启用 --start-group（解决循环依赖）\n",
    "sed -i 's/^ifeq ($(useHavok),1)$/ifeq (1,1)/' build/make/common_footer_config.mak\n",
    "\n",
    "# 补丁 6: 修复 gzguts.h\n",
    "sed -i '/#include <fcntl.h>/a #include <unistd.h>' third_party/zip/gzguts.h\n",
    "\n",
    "echo 'All patches applied'"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 2.4 手动分步构建 — 最终编译"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%%bash\n",
    "cd /home/great/bw-build/programming/bigworld\n",
    "BW_HOST_PLATFORM=el7 make -j$(nproc) bw-binaries"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 2.5 服务器构建产物\n",
    "\n",
    "构建成功后，`/home/great/bw-build/game/bin/server/el7/` 包含：\n",
    "\n",
    "| 二进制文件 | 用途 |\n",
    "|-----------|------|\n",
    "| `server/baseapp` | Base 应用服务器 |\n",
    "| `server/baseappmgr` | Base 应用管理器 |\n",
    "| `server/cellapp` | Cell 应用服务器 |\n",
    "| `server/cellappmgr` | Cell 应用管理器 |\n",
    "| `server/dbapp` | 数据库应用服务器 |\n",
    "| `server/dbappmgr` | 数据库应用管理器 |\n",
    "| `server/loginapp` | 登录应用服务器 |\n",
    "| `server/reviver` | 恢复服务 |\n",
    "| `tools/bwmachined2` | 机器守护进程 |\n",
    "| `tools/bots` | 机器人测试客户端 |\n",
    "| `tools/message_logger` | 消息日志器 |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
