    "---\n",
    "## 4. 构建后配置\n",
    "\n",
    "### 4.1 bwmachined 配置文件"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%%bash\n",
    "# ~/.bwmachined.conf (格式: BW_ROOT;BW_RES_PATH)\n",
    "cat > ~/.bwmachined.conf << 'EOF'\n",
    "great;/home/great/bw-build/game/res/fantasydemo:/home/great/bw-build/game/res/bigworld\n",
    "EOF\n",
    "\n",
    "# /etc/bwmachined.conf (声明管理的组件类型)\n",
    "sudo tee /etc/bwmachined.conf << 'EOF'\n",
    "[Components]\n",
    "baseApp\n",
    "baseAppMgr\n",
    "cellApp\n",
    "cellAppMgr\n",
    "dbApp\n",
    "dbAppMgr\n",
    "loginApp\n",
    "serviceApp\n",
    "EOF"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.2 development_defaults.xml 关键配置\n",
    "\n",
    "| 配置项 | 值 | 说明 |\n",
    "|--------|-----|------|\n",
    "| `<internalInterface>` | `127.0.0.1` | 单机部署必须，否则 baseappmgr 断言失败 |\n",
    "| `<allowLogin>` | `true` | loginApp 默认 false |\n",
    "| `<desiredServiceApps>` | `0` | 无 service app 时必须为 0 |\n",
    "| `<db><type>` | `xml` | 使用 XML 文件数据库 |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.3 生成 LoginApp RSA 密钥对"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%%bash\n",
    "cd /home/great/bw-build/game/res/fantasydemo\n",
    "\n",
    "# 生成 1024 位 RSA 密钥对\n",
    "openssl genrsa -out /tmp/loginapp_privkey.pem 1024 2>/dev/null\n",
    "openssl rsa -in /tmp/loginapp_privkey.pem -pubout -out /tmp/loginapp_pubkey.pem 2>/dev/null\n",
    "\n",
    "# 部署密钥文件\n",
    "mkdir -p server\n",
    "cp /tmp/loginapp_privkey.pem server/loginapp.privkey\n",
    "cp /tmp/loginapp_pubkey.pem loginapp.pubkey"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
