    "---\n",
    "## 5. 运行时部署\n",
    "\n",
    "### 5.1 启动服务器集群\n",
    "\n",
    "**启动顺序（自动处理）：**\n",
    "1. bwmachined2 — 机器守护进程\n",
    "2. cellappmgr, baseappmgr, dbappmgr — 管理器\n",
    "3. dbapp — 数据库\n",
    "4. cellapp — 游戏空间\n",
    "5. baseapp — 玩家实体\n",
    "6. loginapp — 登录入口"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
