    "---\n",
    "## 6. 常见问题排查\n",
    "\n",
    "### LogOnStatus 错误码\n",
    "\n",
    "| 状态码 | 含义 | 解决方案 |\n",
    "|--------|------|----------|\n",
    "| 67 | NO_SUCH_USER | 检查 dbapp 是否运行 |\n",
    "| 68 | INVALID_PASSWORD | 检查登录流程 |\n",
    "| 74 | SERVER_NOT_READY | `desiredServiceApps` 未满足，设为 0 |\n",
    "| 82 | LOGINS_NOT_ALLOWED | `allowLogin` 未开启 |\n",
    "\n",
    "### 服务器进程未全部启动\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "# 检查各进程日志\n",
    "wsl -d Debian -- tail -30 /tmp/cellapp.log\n",
    "wsl -d Debian -- tail -30 /tmp/baseapp.log\n",
    "wsl -d Debian -- tail -30 /tmp/loginapp.log\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### cellapp/baseapp 启动时崩溃\n",
    "\n",
    "`s_moduleTokens` 变量需要 `__attribute__((used))` 属性，防止编译器优化导致 ResMgr 无法注册。已修复于 cellapp.cpp 和 baseapp.cpp。\n",
    "\n",
    "### .def 文件 digest 不匹配\n",
    "\n",
    "客户端和服务器必须使用相同的 .def 文件集。fantasydemo 资源 digest = `BD40F9F72CD5EA96770A69D740A8B643`。dbapp.cpp 中有安全网：digest 不匹配时 WARNING 但不拒绝。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 日志文件位置\n",
    "\n",
    "所有服务器日志位于 `/tmp/`：\n",
    "- `/tmp/bwmachined2.log`\n",
    "- `/tmp/cellappmgr.log`, `/tmp/baseappmgr.log`, `/tmp/dbappmgr.log`\n",
    "- `/tmp/cellapp.log`, `/tmp/baseapp.log`, `/tmp/dbapp.log`, `/tmp/loginapp.log`\",
    "\n",
    "### 保留的关键脚本\n",
    "\n",
    "| 脚本 | 路径 | 用途 |\n",
    "|------|------|------|\n",
    "| `build_bigworld_server.sh` | 根目录 | 服务器一键构建 |\n",
    "| `build_bigworld_client.sh` | 根目录 | 客户端一键构建 |\n",
    "| `setup_wsl.sh` | 根目录 | WSL 环境初始化 |\n",
    "| `start_cluster.sh` | runtime_config/ | 集群启动 |\n",
    "| `check_cluster.sh` | runtime_config/ | 集群状态检查 |\n",
